## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the challenge file using `wget`.
2. Debug the file code with `gdb` and `disassemble` the code with main.
3. Set a breakpoint to the program so that it will calculate the number by running `run` and address of the memory.
4. After conversion add `0x` with hex values based on little endianness then  it is the flag.

